{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From this point forward the game will be changed into The 4th Horizon formerly name Frontier Force Vanguard, with the genre changed to Turn Based tactical RPG.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585040/extras/d0d4b96528dee1d23399e7aa523d427f.avif?t=1759100976\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Frontier Force Vanguard</span></strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> is a strategy game focused on combat, with elements of tower defense and RPG infused into it. Colonize the new continent for the empire, uncover its secrets, and discover why the empire is so eager to gain a foothold here.</span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Settlement</span></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Build towers to protect your settlement.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Research new abilities to help you tackle challenges.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Apply at the Authorization Hub to obtain a building permit.</span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Exploration</span></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Explore the new continent, uncover its secrets, and exploit its resources for the empire.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Take control of the area and claim the resources you gain as rewards.</span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Control</span></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Most of the controls can be used with the mouse. The following is the current control mapping:</span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Left-clicking a building will bring up the building upgrade menu. Holding the click on certain buildings, like the Stockade, will generate production points for construction.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585040/extras/5deab9fbbe59af3f4d50c66c916267d2.avif?t=1759100976\" width=140 height=83 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Right-clicking an empty terrain will bring up the construction menu. Some buildings require specific tiles to be built.</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585040/extras/08cca07e3dc3302246865468b3e4a6a0.avif?t=1759100976\" width=228 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">When the player has a deployable unit, such as a scout, they can use the F1 button or click the unit slot on the right-hand side, then right-click on the target to deploy it.</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585040/extras/0a2c7bff0e276567cf724454bb6439aa.webp?t=1759100976\" width=44 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Combat</span></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Fight in real-time combat and deploy troops to support your battle.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Control your tower's attributes so it attacks with the element your enemy is weak against.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Use magical abilities to overcome enemy immunities.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Some areas have bosses that players need to overcome. Bosses are extremely strong.</span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">Please Note:</span></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Many features are still in development and undergoing fixes. The Authorization Hub is not yet implemented. Once available, it will unlock new building options beyond the default selection.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">**Before purchasing, be aware that each patch carries a high risk of corrupting your previous saves.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585040?t=1759100976","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585040?t=1759100976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585040/7286af7f3e39b4f63d7b6529c1a23c9c4f78c60a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759100976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585040/7286af7f3e39b4f63d7b6529c1a23c9c4f78c60a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759100976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From this point forward the game will be changed into The 4th Horizon formerly name Frontier Force Vanguard, with the genre changed to Turn Based tactical RPG.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585040/extras/d0d4b96528dee1d23399e7aa523d427f.avif?t=1759100976\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p cl